OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2011 as Spain grappled with a
OL,14,     Fdeep economic crisis, a small
OL,15,     Ffishing town in Galicia brought
OL,16,     Fback the peseta almost a decade
OL,17,     Fafter it had been replaced by the
OL,18,     Feuro.
